  "Earned milestones include class, quest, boss, guild and character-slot progression through slot #5.": ["Earned milestones include class, quest, boss, guild and character-slot progression through slot #5.","Meilensteine umfassen Klassen, Quests, Bosse, Gilden und Charakterplätze bis Platz Nr. 5.","Los hitos incluyen progreso de clase, misiones, jefes, gremio y espacios de personaje hasta el n.º 5.","Mijlpalen omvatten klasse-, missie-, baas-, gilde- en personageplekvoortgang tot plek 5.","I traguardi includono classe, missioni, boss, gilda e slot personaggio fino al n. 5.","Les étapes comprennent classe, quêtes, boss, guilde et emplacements de personnage jusqu'au n° 5."],
  "EARNED MILESTONES INCLUDE CLASS, QUEST, BOSS, GUILD AND CHARACTER-SLOT PROGRESSION THROUGH SLOT #5.": ["EARNED MILESTONES INCLUDE CLASS, QUEST, BOSS, GUILD AND CHARACTER-SLOT PROGRESSION THROUGH SLOT #5.","MEILENSTEINE UMFASSEN KLASSEN, QUESTS, BOSSE, GILDEN UND CHARAKTERPLÄTZE BIS PLATZ NR. 5.","LOS HITOS INCLUYEN PROGRESO DE CLASE, MISIONES, JEFES, GREMIO Y ESPACIOS DE PERSONAJE HASTA EL N.º 5.","MIJLPALEN OMVATTEN KLASSE-, MISSIE-, BAAS-, GILDE- EN PERSONAGEPLEKVOORTGANG TOT PLEK 5.","I TRAGUARDI INCLUDONO CLASSE, MISSIONI, BOSS, GILDA E SLOT PERSONAGGIO FINO AL N. 5.","LES ÉTAPES COMPRENNENT CLASSE, QUÊTES, BOSS, GUILDE ET EMPLACEMENTS DE PERSONNAGE JUSQU'AU N° 5."],
