  "Push notifications are not connected in this offline build.": ["Push notifications are not connected in this offline build.","Push-Mitteilungen sind in dieser Offline-Version nicht angebunden.","Las notificaciones push no están conectadas en esta versión sin conexión.","Pushmeldingen zijn niet gekoppeld in deze offlineversie.","Le notifiche push non sono collegate in questa versione offline.","Les notifications push ne sont pas connectées dans cette version hors ligne."],
  "PUSH NOTIFICATIONS ARE NOT CONNECTED IN THIS OFFLINE BUILD.": ["PUSH NOTIFICATIONS ARE NOT CONNECTED IN THIS OFFLINE BUILD.","PUSH-MITTEILUNGEN SIND IN DIESER OFFLINE-VERSION NICHT ANGEBUNDEN.","LAS NOTIFICACIONES PUSH NO ESTÁN CONECTADAS EN ESTA VERSIÓN SIN CONEXIÓN.","PUSHMELDINGEN ZIJN NIET GEKOPPELD IN DEZE OFFLINEVERSIE.","LE NOTIFICHE PUSH NON SONO COLLEGATE IN QUESTA VERSIONE OFFLINE.","LES NOTIFICATIONS PUSH NE SONT PAS CONNECTÉES DANS CETTE VERSION HORS LIGNE."],
  "Notification preferences (coming soon)": ["Notification preferences (coming soon)","Mitteilungseinstellungen (demnächst)","Preferencias de notificaciones (próximamente)","Meldingsvoorkeuren (binnenkort)","Preferenze notifiche (in arrivo)","Préférences de notification (bientôt)"],
