  "A single view of modifiers that are actually active in gameplay right now. Collection ownership is account-wide; selected Faith and permanent boost sources follow the active character.": ["A single view of modifiers that are actually active in gameplay right now. Collection ownership is account-wide; selected Faith and permanent boost sources follow the active character.","Alle aktuell im Spiel aktiven Modifikatoren im Überblick. Sammlungen gelten kontoweit; ausgewählter Glaube und dauerhafte Bonusquellen gehören zum aktiven Charakter.","Una vista de los modificadores activos. Las colecciones son de toda la cuenta; la Fe elegida y las mejoras permanentes siguen al personaje activo.","Een overzicht van alle actieve spelmodifiers. Verzamelingen zijn accountbreed; gekozen geloof en permanente bonussen volgen het actieve personage.","Una vista dei modificatori attivi. Le collezioni sono condivise; Fede selezionata e bonus permanenti seguono il personaggio attivo.","Un aperçu des modificateurs actifs. Les collections concernent le compte ; la Foi choisie et les bonus permanents suivent le personnage actif."],
  "A SINGLE VIEW OF MODIFIERS THAT ARE ACTUALLY ACTIVE IN GAMEPLAY RIGHT NOW. COLLECTION OWNERSHIP IS ACCOUNT-WIDE; SELECTED FAITH AND PERMANENT BOOST SOURCES FOLLOW THE ACTIVE CHARACTER.": ["A SINGLE VIEW OF MODIFIERS THAT ARE ACTUALLY ACTIVE IN GAMEPLAY RIGHT NOW. COLLECTION OWNERSHIP IS ACCOUNT-WIDE; SELECTED FAITH AND PERMANENT BOOST SOURCES FOLLOW THE ACTIVE CHARACTER.","ALLE AKTUELL IM SPIEL AKTIVEN MODIFIKATOREN IM ÜBERBLICK. SAMMLUNGEN GELTEN KONTOWEIT; AUSGEWÄHLTER GLAUBE UND DAUERHAFTE BONUSQUELLEN GEHÖREN ZUM AKTIVEN CHARAKTER.","UNA VISTA DE LOS MODIFICADORES ACTIVOS. LAS COLECCIONES SON DE TODA LA CUENTA; LA FE ELEGIDA Y LAS MEJORAS PERMANENTES SIGUEN AL PERSONAJE ACTIVO.","EEN OVERZICHT VAN ALLE ACTIEVE SPELMODIFIERS. VERZAMELINGEN ZIJN ACCOUNTBREED; GEKOZEN GELOOF EN PERMANENTE BONUSSEN VOLGEN HET ACTIEVE PERSONAGE.","UNA VISTA DEI MODIFICATORI ATTIVI. LE COLLEZIONI SONO CONDIVISE; FEDE SELEZIONATA E BONUS PERMANENTI SEGUONO IL PERSONAGGIO ATTIVO.","UN APERÇU DES MODIFICATEURS ACTIFS. LES COLLECTIONS CONCERNENT LE COMPTE ; LA FOI CHOISIE ET LES BONUS PERMANENTS SUIVENT LE PERSONNAGE ACTIF."],
