  "No permanent gameplay modifiers are active on this character yet.": ["No permanent gameplay modifiers are active on this character yet.","Dieser Charakter hat noch keine dauerhaften Spielmodifikatoren.","Este personaje aún no tiene modificadores permanentes activos.","Dit personage heeft nog geen permanente spelmodifiers.","Questo personaggio non ha ancora modificatori permanenti attivi.","Ce personnage n'a pas encore de modificateurs permanents actifs."],
  "NO PERMANENT GAMEPLAY MODIFIERS ARE ACTIVE ON THIS CHARACTER YET.": ["NO PERMANENT GAMEPLAY MODIFIERS ARE ACTIVE ON THIS CHARACTER YET.","DIESER CHARAKTER HAT NOCH KEINE DAUERHAFTEN SPIELMODIFIKATOREN.","ESTE PERSONAJE AÚN NO TIENE MODIFICADORES PERMANENTES ACTIVOS.","DIT PERSONAGE HEEFT NOG GEEN PERMANENTE SPELMODIFIERS.","QUESTO PERSONAGGIO NON HA ANCORA MODIFICATORI PERMANENTI ATTIVI.","CE PERSONNAGE N'A PAS ENCORE DE MODIFICATEURS PERMANENTS ACTIFS."],
