  "{name} · activate one banked boost at a time. Its timer runs only while matching activity is being completed, including eligible offline settlement.": ["{name} · activate one banked boost at a time. Its timer runs only while matching activity is being completed, including eligible offline settlement.","{name} · Aktiviere jeweils einen gespeicherten Bonus. Der Timer läuft nur bei passenden Aktivitäten, einschließlich geeigneter Offline-Abrechnungen.","{name} · activa una mejora guardada a la vez. Su temporizador solo avanza con actividades correspondientes, incluida la liquidación sin conexión válida.","{name} · activeer één bewaarde bonus tegelijk. De timer loopt alleen tijdens passende activiteiten, inclusief geschikte offlineafrekening.","{name} · attiva un bonus accumulato alla volta. Il timer scorre solo durante attività corrispondenti, inclusi i conteggi offline idonei.","{name} · activez un bonus stocké à la fois. Son compteur avance uniquement lors d'activités correspondantes, y compris les calculs hors ligne admissibles."],
