  "Next character slot unlocks at {count} combined account skill levels.": ["Next character slot unlocks at {count} combined account skill levels.","Der nächste Charakterplatz wird bei {count} kombinierten Kontofertigkeitsstufen freigeschaltet.","El próximo espacio de personaje se desbloquea con {count} niveles de habilidad combinados de la cuenta.","De volgende personageplek ontgrendelt bij {count} gezamenlijke accountvaardigheidsniveaus.","Il prossimo slot si sblocca a {count} livelli abilità combinati dell'account.","Le prochain emplacement se débloque à {count} niveaux de compétence cumulés du compte."],
  "All 5 character slots are permanently unlocked.": ["All 5 character slots are permanently unlocked.","Alle 5 Charakterplätze sind dauerhaft freigeschaltet.","Los 5 espacios de personaje están desbloqueados permanentemente.","Alle 5 personageplekken zijn permanent ontgrendeld.","Tutti e 5 gli slot personaggio sono sbloccati per sempre.","Les 5 emplacements de personnage sont débloqués définitivement."],
  "ALL 5 CHARACTER SLOTS ARE PERMANENTLY UNLOCKED.": ["ALL 5 CHARACTER SLOTS ARE PERMANENTLY UNLOCKED.","ALLE 5 CHARAKTERPLÄTZE SIND DAUERHAFT FREIGESCHALTET.","LOS 5 ESPACIOS DE PERSONAJE ESTÁN DESBLOQUEADOS PERMANENTEMENTE.","ALLE 5 PERSONAGEPLEKKEN ZIJN PERMANENT ONTGRENDELD.","TUTTI E 5 GLI SLOT PERSONAGGIO SONO SBLOCCATI PER SEMPRE.","LES 5 EMPLACEMENTS DE PERSONNAGE SONT DÉBLOQUÉS DÉFINITIVEMENT."],
