  "VIP, VIP+ and Supporter purchases are available in the Android Google Play build.": ["VIP, VIP+ and Supporter purchases are available in the Android Google Play build.","VIP, VIP+ und Supporter sind in der Android-Version von Google Play erhältlich.","Las compras de VIP, VIP+ y Supporter están disponibles en la versión Android de Google Play.","VIP, VIP+ en Supporter zijn beschikbaar in de Android-versie van Google Play.","Gli acquisti VIP, VIP+ e Supporter sono disponibili nella versione Android Google Play.","Les achats VIP, VIP+ et Supporter sont disponibles dans la version Android Google Play."],
  "VIP, VIP+ AND SUPPORTER PURCHASES ARE AVAILABLE IN THE ANDROID GOOGLE PLAY BUILD.": ["VIP, VIP+ AND SUPPORTER PURCHASES ARE AVAILABLE IN THE ANDROID GOOGLE PLAY BUILD.","VIP, VIP+ UND SUPPORTER SIND IN DER ANDROID-VERSION VON GOOGLE PLAY ERHÄLTLICH.","LAS COMPRAS DE VIP, VIP+ Y SUPPORTER ESTÁN DISPONIBLES EN LA VERSIÓN ANDROID DE GOOGLE PLAY.","VIP, VIP+ EN SUPPORTER ZIJN BESCHIKBAAR IN DE ANDROID-VERSIE VAN GOOGLE PLAY.","GLI ACQUISTI VIP, VIP+ E SUPPORTER SONO DISPONIBILI NELLA VERSIONE ANDROID GOOGLE PLAY.","LES ACHATS VIP, VIP+ ET SUPPORTER SONT DISPONIBLES DANS LA VERSION ANDROID GOOGLE PLAY."],
