  "Payment pending. Benefits activate after Google Play confirms payment.": ["Payment pending. Benefits activate after Google Play confirms payment.","Zahlung ausstehend. Vorteile werden nach Zahlungsbestätigung durch Google Play aktiviert.","Pago pendiente. Los beneficios se activan cuando Google Play confirme el pago.","Betaling in behandeling. Voordelen activeren nadat Google Play de betaling bevestigt.","Pagamento in sospeso. I vantaggi si attivano dopo la conferma di Google Play.","Paiement en attente. Les avantages s'activent après confirmation par Google Play."],
  "PAYMENT PENDING. BENEFITS ACTIVATE AFTER GOOGLE PLAY CONFIRMS PAYMENT.": ["PAYMENT PENDING. BENEFITS ACTIVATE AFTER GOOGLE PLAY CONFIRMS PAYMENT.","ZAHLUNG AUSSTEHEND. VORTEILE WERDEN NACH ZAHLUNGSBESTÄTIGUNG DURCH GOOGLE PLAY AKTIVIERT.","PAGO PENDIENTE. LOS BENEFICIOS SE ACTIVAN CUANDO GOOGLE PLAY CONFIRME EL PAGO.","BETALING IN BEHANDELING. VOORDELEN ACTIVEREN NADAT GOOGLE PLAY DE BETALING BEVESTIGT.","PAGAMENTO IN SOSPESO. I VANTAGGI SI ATTIVANO DOPO LA CONFERMA DI GOOGLE PLAY.","PAIEMENT EN ATTENTE. LES AVANTAGES S'ACTIVENT APRÈS CONFIRMATION PAR GOOGLE PLAY."],
  "Purchase verified by Google Play and applied to your VELDRYN account.": ["Purchase verified by Google Play and applied to your VELDRYN account.","Kauf von Google Play bestätigt und deinem VELDRYN-Konto zugewiesen.","Compra verificada por Google Play y aplicada a tu cuenta VELDRYN.","Aankoop geverifieerd door Google Play en toegepast op je VELDRYN-account.","Acquisto verificato da Google Play e applicato all'account VELDRYN.","Achat vérifié par Google Play et appliqué à votre compte VELDRYN."],
  "PURCHASE VERIFIED BY GOOGLE PLAY AND APPLIED TO YOUR VELDRYN ACCOUNT.": ["PURCHASE VERIFIED BY GOOGLE PLAY AND APPLIED TO YOUR VELDRYN ACCOUNT.","KAUF VON GOOGLE PLAY BESTÄTIGT UND DEINEM VELDRYN-KONTO ZUGEWIESEN.","COMPRA VERIFICADA POR GOOGLE PLAY Y APLICADA A TU CUENTA VELDRYN.","AANKOOP GEVERIFIEERD DOOR GOOGLE PLAY EN TOEGEPAST OP JE VELDRYN-ACCOUNT.","ACQUISTO VERIFICATO DA GOOGLE PLAY E APPLICATO ALL'ACCOUNT VELDRYN.","ACHAT VÉRIFIÉ PAR GOOGLE PLAY ET APPLIQUÉ À VOTRE COMPTE VELDRYN."],
