  "No restorable VELDRYN purchases were found for this Google Play account.": ["No restorable VELDRYN purchases were found for this Google Play account.","Für dieses Google-Play-Konto wurden keine wiederherstellbaren VELDRYN-Käufe gefunden.","No se encontraron compras VELDRYN restaurables en esta cuenta de Google Play.","Geen herstelbare VELDRYN-aankopen gevonden voor dit Google Play-account.","Nessun acquisto VELDRYN ripristinabile trovato per questo account Google Play.","Aucun achat VELDRYN restaurable trouvé pour ce compte Google Play."],
  "NO RESTORABLE VELDRYN PURCHASES WERE FOUND FOR THIS GOOGLE PLAY ACCOUNT.": ["NO RESTORABLE VELDRYN PURCHASES WERE FOUND FOR THIS GOOGLE PLAY ACCOUNT.","FÜR DIESES GOOGLE-PLAY-KONTO WURDEN KEINE WIEDERHERSTELLBAREN VELDRYN-KÄUFE GEFUNDEN.","NO SE ENCONTRARON COMPRAS VELDRYN RESTAURABLES EN ESTA CUENTA DE GOOGLE PLAY.","GEEN HERSTELBARE VELDRYN-AANKOPEN GEVONDEN VOOR DIT GOOGLE PLAY-ACCOUNT.","NESSUN ACQUISTO VELDRYN RIPRISTINABILE TROVATO PER QUESTO ACCOUNT GOOGLE PLAY.","AUCUN ACHAT VELDRYN RESTAURABLE TROUVÉ POUR CE COMPTE GOOGLE PLAY."],
