  "SAVE NEW PASSWORD": ["SAVE NEW PASSWORD","NEUES PASSWORT SPEICHERN","GUARDAR NUEVA CONTRASEÑA","NIEUW WACHTWOORD OPSLAAN","SALVA NUOVA PASSWORD","ENREGISTRER LE NOUVEAU MOT DE PASSE"],
  "Password updated.": ["Password updated.","Passwort aktualisiert.","Contraseña actualizada.","Wachtwoord bijgewerkt.","Password aggiornata.","Mot de passe mis à jour."],
  "PASSWORD UPDATED.": ["PASSWORD UPDATED.","PASSWORT AKTUALISIERT.","CONTRASEÑA ACTUALIZADA.","WACHTWOORD BIJGEWERKT.","PASSWORD AGGIORNATA.","MOT DE PASSE MIS À JOUR."],
