  "Character could not be deleted.": ["Character could not be deleted.","Der Charakter konnte nicht gelöscht werden.","No se pudo eliminar el personaje.","Het personage kon niet worden verwijderd.","Impossibile eliminare il personaggio.","Le personnage n'a pas pu être supprimé."],
  "CHARACTER COULD NOT BE DELETED.": ["CHARACTER COULD NOT BE DELETED.","DER CHARAKTER KONNTE NICHT GELÖSCHT WERDEN.","NO SE PUDO ELIMINAR EL PERSONAJE.","HET PERSONAGE KON NIET WORDEN VERWIJDERD.","IMPOSSIBILE ELIMINARE IL PERSONAGGIO.","LE PERSONNAGE N'A PAS PU ÊTRE SUPPRIMÉ."],
  "Character is not owned.": ["Character is not owned.","Dieser Charakter gehört dir nicht.","Este personaje no te pertenece.","Dit personage is niet van jou.","Questo personaggio non ti appartiene.","Ce personnage ne vous appartient pas."],
  "CHARACTER IS NOT OWNED.": ["CHARACTER IS NOT OWNED.","DIESER CHARAKTER GEHÖRT DIR NICHT.","ESTE PERSONAJE NO TE PERTENECE.","DIT PERSONAGE IS NIET VAN JOU.","QUESTO PERSONAGGIO NON TI APPARTIENE.","CE PERSONNAGE NE VOUS APPARTIENT PAS."],
