  "Gather regional resources, process them and craft upgrades over time.": ["Gather regional resources, process them and craft upgrades over time.","Sammle regionale Ressourcen, verarbeite sie und stelle Verbesserungen her.","Recolecta recursos regionales, procésalos y fabrica mejoras con el tiempo.","Verzamel regionale grondstoffen, verwerk ze en maak verbeteringen.","Raccogli risorse regionali, lavorale e crea miglioramenti nel tempo.","Récoltez des ressources régionales, transformez-les et fabriquez des améliorations."],
